# Always deploy this family app

This rule is **only** for `kdrcoding/myfamilytree`. Do not apply it to KDR Coding or other repos.

After finishing user-requested work that should go live:

1. Commit the real app changes. Never commit `.tmp-deploy/`, `scripts/tmp-*`, `.env`, preview images, or secrets.
2. Push to `origin` `main`. Never force-push.
3. Deploy production to Vercel (`npx vercel --prod --yes` if a GitHub push is not enough).
4. Reply with the live URLs.

Do this without waiting to be asked again. Skip only if the user says not to deploy, or the change is a local-only experiment.

- Repo: https://github.com/kdrcoding/myfamilytree
- Vercel project: `myfamilytree` (`prj_EKfDhTJUicNZASpvAY5ChkCYcRQl`)
- Live: https://myfamilytree-smoky.vercel.app (also https://myfamilytree-kdr6.vercel.app)
